## Layer Description

| Layer | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| Control Center | Blueprint, standards, templates and configuration |
| Platform Core | Generator, validator, scheduler and automation framework |
| Engines | Financial intelligence engines |
| Domains | Business domain implementation |
| Products | Reusable financial products |
| Interfaces | CLI, APIs and external integrations |
| Shared | Common utilities and helpers |
| Reports | Generated project artifacts |

